{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_title", "source_sha256": "1089dbfba48953ad5353280c1dfa76125253eda4aa35998ec04e407cc96e5ad7", "ja": "キラキラの毎日、キラキラの明日", "zh": "闪亮的每天，耀眼的明天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2daa370bad9b04569fc87a18322b3226877c832f4fee74872c034fda9dd6b750", "ja": "次回公演のセンターに指名されたものの、気\n乗りしない様子の翼。しかし、通りかかった\n美希がセンターに立候補したことで突然やる\n気モードに。レッスンはサボりがちなまま、\nそのセンスで無事に公演を乗りきる。", "zh": "翼虽然被指定为下次公演的Center，\n却一副兴趣缺缺的样子。然而在路过的美希\n表示自己也想当Center后，翼突然变得充满\n干劲。尽管练习时常常偷懒，她仍凭借着天分\n顺利完成公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "314be6c326f9fc818e82b4071140900281e3b679a97cd77e3aff997a5dd87183", "ja": "（翼の初センターが終わった……すごい歓声だ。\nステージの裏まで届いてくる）", "zh": "（翼的第一次Center表演结束了……现场欢声雷动。\n甚至连在后台都能听得见。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4627dbabc6ab9787449a79e8ca63edfa34ffdefc6671c1a79f93e8c1189d73d7", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん！", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e09c77690016a24d6ad954da87b1ea27b2cb97187343ec47b6f2add6cbfa7bf2", "ja": "翼、お疲れさま。", "zh": "翼，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e141c7bc8a083a920497049c83817fa093479d127476c24f01a8c37e42534b17", "ja": "ねえねえ、わたし、どうでしたか？\n可愛かったですか～？", "zh": "欸欸，我的表演如何？\n很可爱吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "84b687317b739517587185bec430f0949a9eef2d1973c75c818843f88b89bca4", "ja": "ああ、すごく可愛かったよ。\nやっぱり、翼をセンターにして正解だったな。", "zh": "嗯嗯，非常可爱喔。\n选翼当Center果然是正确的选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0f0896436bb2a1c89d73ccb5c5e52e0eff7624d4614f474719ecf76a93363b1d", "ja": "やったぁ♪", "zh": "太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "019fc12ddf220dff9b613134f90fbad8d09278030d0a5edf6f3fbc16d5bb7191", "ja": "（翼は、あれから真面目に練習する……でもなく、\nレッスンは常にサボり気味だったが、それでも……）", "zh": "（翼在那之后……也没有认真练习，\n参加训练课程时也常常偷懒，尽管如此……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "44ca38f4cfcf919057539f43aec1ad9a3c1be245aafc76e70563bef4ab549d7d", "ja": "まったくもう、翼ってば信じられない！\nあんなにレッスンをサボってばかりだったのに！", "zh": "真是的，翼实在太夸张了！\n明明那么常偷懒不练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "c77aab525cb93285f16819fd5c47cb1b1f0ff7e1810dd3c24efa1342b2055633", "ja": "それなのに、こんなに成功しちゃうなんて……はぁ。", "zh": "却能表演得这么成功……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "10b1d3278dad20e4be3186b2108c8ec9e853a5b9efbc150c496a38b29e169f58", "ja": "うんうん！　なんか、バーッてして、\nわーって感じで、スゴかったよね～！", "zh": "嗯嗯！感觉全场一下就亮起来，\n然后气氛超热烈，好厉害喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e9ffc70010fcfc3e62da2f1dc9117af33b1ba17572f2c5972800f64364609ef1", "ja": "そうだな。一時はどうなることかと思ったけど……\nとにかく、無事に終わってよかったよ。", "zh": "是啊，我还担心不知道会怎么样呢……\n总之能顺利结束，真的是可喜可贺。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "23d24d0e61895ae5149056957ddd3a1fc4805773cf25fd567714b34f26a782f0", "ja": "えへへ♪\nだから、心配ないって言ったじゃないですか～。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪\n所以我就说不用担心嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "21a1d6a78685a7250cb35d30611e9e80b763bdb31aff9778ca9478c47b808910", "ja": "{$P$}、みんなっ。\n公演お疲れさまなの～。", "zh": "{$P$}、大家！\n公演辛苦了唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "27a97a60ecf5ac4bfb05cb3577b7962e7945867df2924cd8b163e77220d5fab7", "ja": "あっ、美希ちゃんだ～♪\nもしかして、観ててくれたんですか？", "zh": "啊，美希～♪\n难道说，你是来看我们的表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "afc717ea32c42d96d65e1c7d4466c756533594957e63ea3829549556431cfda8", "ja": "もちろん。センターがんばったね、翼。\nミキ的には、けっこうよかったって思うな☆", "zh": "当然呀，你很努力当好Center呢，翼。\n美希觉得很不错唷☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2c8d5aeae981b4c81ca995ebda6c8499638e1e5ab44801a7172b5514822893e6", "ja": "ホントですか！？\nやった、美希ちゃんに褒められちゃった♪", "zh": "真的吗！？\n太棒了，被美希夸奖了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "1c7fcd4a2e7b4c265cce4749ea5609e8eb51acbbfa585c596da97f6b64f5ab1d", "ja": "まったく、翼はまた美希さんになついて……。", "zh": "真是的，翼又在缠着美希了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "b0234868987d10d83e49e2e62a34c12d012a0b6e0034a4399dc1c90b66ebc450", "ja": "翼って、ホント美希ちゃんのこと好きだよね～。", "zh": "翼真的很喜欢美希呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e6ee6a2f07cd392fef46c91eee995e6fb1d3491203703ab10e4a1ab308df9df6", "ja": "うん！　だってわたし、\n美希ちゃんみたいに、モテモテになりたいんだもん！", "zh": "嗯！因为我想像美希一样，\n变得很受欢迎嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6a0ba08fc1805f8b23b0df6219379d807c7bc0fc6125cd90b3b1649d875df128", "ja": "そのために、アイドルになったんだもんね～♪", "zh": "我就是为了这个，才来当偶像的唷～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "df3cb1a32175b085ab0a34b9ff36af125c01b8a0a3d24e7cd08a658d48d859c9", "ja": "でも最後の合わせるとこ、翼だけちょっとずれてたの。\nだからー、まだまだってカンジ！", "zh": "不过最后动作一致的地方，只有翼稍微歪掉了。\n所以──还有改进空间的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "76c6f9667f4fdffd763618dbf71414d4eadd0f874fe24943ff767dac5de809c8", "ja": "え～っ！　そんなぁ～。", "zh": "咦～！怎么这样～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "9a82f63845a707c3ba67b24b6afa76674862f06cce9598d0374ac408bd67c901", "ja": "またセンターに立つなら、ミキに教えてね。\n楽しみにしてる！　バイバーイ☆", "zh": "你下次再当Center时，要跟美希说喔。\n美希很期待！掰掰☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "916a26cd737d74d8669f025cbf613070c081e8eb9d593e9870fb542981a78400", "ja": "美希ちゃん……最後まで、\nしっかり見ててくれたんだね。", "zh": "美希……\n有认真看到最后呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1026_p", "source_sha256": "7ad2e1f523bceaeb91ca25fac206aa913c8f2087230e5244506287503a95b18d", "ja": "そうだな。今回は上手くいったけど、\n毎回ハラハラするステージじゃ困るぞ、翼。", "zh": "就是说啊。这次虽然很顺利，\n但每次表演都这么提心吊胆就伤脑筋了，翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1027_p", "source_sha256": "17c935bc37235c127d8c70849adfdf074b44420e8de36385a8ad2fbed6e3d2cb", "ja": "次はちゃんと、みんなと一緒にレッスンを受ける\nんだ。でないと、センターは任せないからな！", "zh": "你下次要和大家一起好好练习，\n不然就不让你当Center啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8a095ebfde003184556c431ec1e1cc4dd0d964a1b0789fcffdf19cca767097b1", "ja": "は～い。", "zh": "好啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1029_p", "source_sha256": "aafa6017b78bab6fa3f7c33fce6915cd26bec2c7566a028f14543c6396e8bc5c", "ja": "なんだか、のん気な返事だけど……\nちゃんとわかってるのか？", "zh": "总觉得你回答得很随便……\n你真的有听进去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ef43bd942c58f277cb687fcc97e0ff7487d479482a53c9d65ee3540654eb6ee6", "ja": "も～、ちゃんとわかってますってば～。\nそれより、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "有啦～我真的有在听～\n先不说这个，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b42d87d47ed5570487eedc93b0e54388f2f779319334631db2b396c57f2bb8f7", "ja": "ライブ成功したから、わたしに、ご褒美くださいね！\n大人っぽいデート♪", "zh": "演唱会成功后，会给我奖励对吧！\n成熟大人风格的约会♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1032_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1695b5e7f3432cfd9ee1cffabd959871105e9a014c2ed911872474f5849619b2", "ja": "美希ちゃんには、いいって言ったじゃないですか～。\n約束は、約束ですよ～。", "zh": "你不是有答应美希吗～？\n约定就是约定喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1034_p", "source_sha256": "2e4dad99b9663988bc4f6bbc8eb36475b1f6af2e4812ee670a1f4c1ab85db47c", "ja": "ああ、美希へのご褒美の話か。\nう～ん、そうだなぁ……。", "zh": "啊啊，给美希奖励的那件事啊。\n唔嗯～说得也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_003_1035_p", "source_sha256": "657719cbcc121f56cdda594ee071d6c49ede696797ad726ace4f14e6f6750940", "ja": "でも翼は、結局サボり気味だったわけだし……。\nよし、今回のご褒美はファミレスだ。", "zh": "可是翼最后还是常常偷懒……\n那好，这次就带你去家庭餐厅当作奖励。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
